# Secret Tunnel: "{4}, {T}: Two target creatures you control that share a creature type can't be blocked this turn" (CR 509.1b,
# 611.2). Bot1's Water Tribe Captain and Earth Kingdom Protectors are both Human Soldier Allies. With three Moxen's mana the
# ability is refused ({4} exactly: Mox Emerald is still in hand); with the fourth it is paid and both are flagged. On the
# attack Bot2's Ornithopter may not block either, but may block Bot1's own Ornithopter (the positive control: it shares
# no type with either and was not chosen), so Bot2 takes 3 + 1 = 4.

